{"availability":"available","full":"wasi-master/wmkeyboard","name":"wmkeyboard","description":"A modern, privacy-first Android keyboard: offline intelligence, 600+ languages, themes, tools and an addon ecosystem.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Kotlin","stars":566,"forks":31,"created":"2026-08-10T12:14:22Z","updated":"2026-10-16T21:23:55Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://wmkeyboard.pages.dev","topics":["android","bengali","ime","input-method","jetpack-compose","keyboard","kotlin","material-you","privacy"],"demo":"https://wmkeyboard.pages.dev/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T12:31:07.913Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T12:31:07.913Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T12:31:07.913Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T01:10:19.562Z","stars":503,"forks":22},{"at":"2026-10-13T04:16:21.109Z","stars":531,"forks":26},{"at":"2026-10-15T13:02:21.652Z","stars":552,"forks":27},{"at":"2026-10-16T18:02:31.823Z","stars":561,"forks":30},{"at":"2026-10-17T12:31:07.913Z","stars":566,"forks":31}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An open source multilingual Android keyboard with prediction, glide typing, transliteration, emoji search and a 75+ tool toolbox that all run on the phone and never phone home.","A keyboard is the one app that sees everything you write. Your messages, your passwords, your half-typed thoughts you deleted before sending. Somewhere along the way the popular keyboards decided that was a business model. The prediction got better, and the price for that was a copy of your keystrokes getting sent to somebody else's server.","The keyboards that refused that deal were mostly forks of the same decade-old Android code. Good bones, honest intentions, but no glide typing without a proprietary blob, no real toolbox, and nothing for the language I actually type in. Bangla was an afterthought everywhere: either a phonetic engine bolted on with no prediction, or a layout with no smart features behind it."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/wasi-master/wmkeyboard/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"5a555a66ff632df80339a85b3f662004f9d6140d71cee0a6008fa68e5bffdcb9","extractedAt":"2026-10-15T13:02:21.785Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T12:31:07.998Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"An open source multilingual Android keyboard with prediction, glide typing, transliteration, emoji search and a 75+ tool toolbox that all run on the phone and never phone home.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/wasi-master/wmkeyboard/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"No analytics SDK, no crash reporting, no account, and no server of mine for the app to reach.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/wasi-master/wmkeyboard/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"5a555a66ff632df80339a85b3f662004f9d6140d71cee0a6008fa68e5bffdcb9","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/wasi-master/wmkeyboard/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-17T12:31:07.998Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-16T21:23:55Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/wasi-master/wmkeyboard/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-17T12:31:08.000Z","hash":"5a555a66ff632df80339a85b3f662004f9d6140d71cee0a6008fa68e5bffdcb9","originalBytes":29339,"storedBytes":29339,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T12:31:07.913Z","subjects":["Android","Mobile","Privacy & security"],"platforms":["Android"],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Developer tools","subjects":["Android","Mobile","Privacy & security"],"evidence":[{"subject":"Android","source":"metadata","match":"Android"},{"subject":"Mobile","source":"metadata","match":"Android"},{"subject":"Privacy & security","source":"metadata","match":"privacy first"}],"platformEvidence":[{"platform":"Android","source":"metadata","match":"Android"}],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects"